  "vibe": "Deep moss (#3e4a36) and bark brown (#5c4633) grounds under cream (#efe9db) type, with chanterelle gold (#d9913b) and fern green (#7ba05b) doing the picking. Vollkorn's sturdy bookish serif over Alegreya Sans. The world grows in front of you: five mushrooms pop up from the ground line on staggered outBack scales — cream stems, domed caps alternating gold and fern, wart dots on the even ones — nine spore motes drift through the mid-frame on crossed sine and cosine loops, and a fern frond on the left sways ±10° with four pairs of pinnae. Its own beats are the basket checklist that ticks itself off and the drag that carries a find into a slot. Springier than its calm siblings: rise titles, pop items, a 0.7 roll and a pushD in the camera set. For foraging walks, nature schools, botanical brands and outdoor guiding.",
